er used together with the false Lemma 6.1, so its utility is compromised.\n\n14. **Lemma 7.1 and identity (30)** – Lemma 7.1 derives the relation  \n    \\[\n    m\\!\\Bigl(-\\frac{u}{2}\\Bigr)+\\frac{v}{2}+y_{H}-m x_{p}=0\\tag{30}\n    \\]  \n    by invoking Lemma 6.1 (which is false) and the incorrect expressions for \\(u,v\\). Hence (30) is unsupported – a **Critical Error**.\n\n15. **Final tangency verification** – The condition (25) for tangency is correctly stated, but the equality is claimed to follow from (30) and the (incorrect) values of \\(u,v,w\\). Since the preceding identities are false, the conclusion that the line through \\(H\\) parallel to \\(AP\\) is tangent to the circumcircle of \\(\\triangle BEF\\) is not proved. This is a **Critical Error**.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:** The solution contains multiple critical algebraic mistakes (incorrect quadratic, wrong formulas for the points \\(E\\) and \\(F\\), erroneous determinant \\(\\Delta\\), false Lemma 6.1, and consequently false identities leading to the final tangency claim). Because these errors break the logical chain, the proof does not establish the required result. The solution is therefore **invalid**."
